# Collector inclusion

On collector work, do not drop these. Checklist rows are a reminder, not a new lock.

- Establish finishes history, future dates, and the ROC check before the first lot is saved. Research does not post lots.
- Runtime declarations use the stored Template Dividend URL. ROC uses the stored Template ROC URL. Do not invent a URL in code.
- A failed collect opens a ticket and does not wipe paid history.
- A ROC miss does not mark the declaration run as failed.
- last_run_ok alone is not complete.
